{
  "name": "3gpp-5gc",
  "description": "Example profile for a 3GPP 5G core network (5GC). Public 3GPP vocabulary only (TS 23.501, TS 23.502, TS 33.501): network functions, their reference points and service-based interfaces, procedures and RM/CM states. Deployables use the conventional lower-case network-function directory names (amf/, smf/, ...); copy the file and adjust them to your repository layout.",
  "system_description": "a 3GPP 5G core network",
